<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<text>
<p>PARIS, 11 fevrier, Reuter - First round results in the</p>
<p>$450.000 Paris Open women's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix</p>
<p>numbers denote seeds):</p>
<p>Kristie Boogert (Netherlands) beat Sandrine Testud (France) 0-6</p>
<p>6-1 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>5-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) 6-4</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Silvia Farina (Italy) beat Katarina Studenikova (Slovakia) 3-6</p>
<p>6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Adriana Gersi (Czech Republic) beat Andrea Glass (Germany) 7-5</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>7-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Henrieta Nagyova</p>
<p>(Slovakia) 4-6 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) beat Maria Strandlund (Sweden) 6-2</p>
<p>6-7 (3-7) 6-1</p>
</text>
